ttps://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":11,"created_at":"2026-07-17T02:21:35Z","updated_at":"2026-08-13T17:26:32Z","closed_at":"2026-08-13T17:26:32Z","assignee":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nThis bug is on **all versions** **4.6 and above**\n\nI've tested Godot 4.5, 4.5.1, and 4.5.2 and they **don't have this issue**. but 4.6, 4.7, and even the 4.8 dev build **have this bug.**\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.8.dev1 - Android 16 (SDK 36 build 14587043) - Single-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Mobile) - integrated PowerVR D-Series DXT-48-1536 MC1 - Tensor G5 (8 threads) - Android (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\n\n**The main issue is**: that some editor shortcuts **work perfectly**  e.g.. :\n\n - Undo\n  - Redo\n  - Cut\n  - Delete Line\n\nWhile others **don't work** e.g.. :\n\n - Toggle Comment\n - Fold All lines\n  - Unfold All Lines.\n\n\n**But all actions do work normally**; if I go to the script toolbar and select them from there.\n\n<img width=\"679\" height=\"1063\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/38267a38-dad9-4ba0-bbf1-784404d58b54\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n### Input the key combination for these actions:\n\n**Toggle Comment**: _CTR + K_\n**Fold Line**: _ALT + F_\n\n**Even after modifying the shortcuts in editor settings the issue still remains.**\n\n\nThe keyboard I'm using is called **Unexpected Keyboard**, which is available in the Play Store, \n\n\n<img width=\"2401\" height=\"587\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5f67f11f-65f3-40c9-a93d-16305037a55f\" />\n\nit contains keys like : *CTR, FN, ALT*, which allow me to input keys that I otherwise can't on mobile, I've also tested this with another keyboard called **Hacker's Keyboard**:\n\n<img width=\"2404\" height=\"682\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e96bc67c-e329-40b0-9244-7e42c4b49208\" />\n\nAnd it has the same issue. Which confirms the problem is with *Godot* and **Not the digital keyboards**.\n\n\n\n**Note**: This issue didn't exist in any of the versions of Godot 4.5.1 or or 4.5.2, it only appeared in 4.6 and above.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121485/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121485/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}